            "support_faq": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS",
            "faq_what_protects": "What does the system protect against?",
            "faq_what_protects_answer": "ALADDIN protects you from 100+ types of online dangers. Think of it as a guard for your phone—it keeps the bad guys out and shields you from viruses, scammers, and dangerous websites.\n\nOur system works 24/7 and checks everything that happens on your device.",
            "faq_protect_children": "How does the system protect children?",
            "faq_protect_children_answer": "We protect kids like real superheroes! 🦸\n\n• We block dangerous websites (like a fence around a playground)\n• We stop marathon gaming sessions (help them take breaks)\n• We make sure strangers cannot message your child\n• We teach digital safety through games (fun and useful!)\n• Parents see what's happening (without reading private messages)",
            "faq_protect_elderly": "How does the system protect seniors?",
            "faq_protect_elderly_answer": "We built a special shield for grandparents:\n\n• We block scam calls (fraudsters target seniors first)\n• We verify every website before it opens\n• The interface is simple—even if you rarely use a smartphone\n• You can control it with your voice (say \"call my grandson\" and it dials instantly)\n• A red SOS button calls for help in one tap",
            "faq_data_safe": "Are my data safe?",
            "faq_data_safe_answer": "Yes, your data stay fully protected! 🔒\n\nWe use:\n• Military-grade encryption (the same as banks and the army)\n• All data stored in Russia\n• Full compliance with data-protection laws\n• Premium plan adds total anonymity (even we cannot identify you)",
            "faq_viruses_trojans": "What are viruses and trojans?",
            "faq_viruses_trojans_answer": "A virus on your phone is like a cold for a computer. It can:\n• Delete your photos\n• Steal passwords\n• Break your phone\n\nA trojan is a virus that hides inside a pretty app (like the Trojan horse). You think you installed a game, but it's really malware!\n\n✅ ALADDIN detects and removes viruses before they cause damage.",
            "faq_ransomware": "What is ransomware?",
            "faq_ransomware_answer": "It's a nasty bandit virus! It locks all your files and demands money to get them back.\n\nHow it happens:\n1. You download a malicious program\n2. It encrypts (locks) every file\n3. A message appears: \"Pay 50,000₽ or lose everything!\"\n\n✅ ALADDIN keeps ransomware from reaching your phone.",
            "faq_spyware": "What is spyware?",
            "faq_spyware_answer": "Spyware is an invisible app that watches you:\n• Sees your passwords\n• Reads your messages\n• Tracks where you go\n• Listens to conversations\n\nIt's like someone following you and writing down everything you do!\n\n✅ ALADDIN finds spies and removes them.",
            "faq_phishing_sites": "What are phishing websites?",
            "faq_phishing_sites_answer": "Phishing happens when scammers make a fake site that looks like a real bank or store.\n\nHow it works:\n1. You think you're on your bank's site\n2. You enter your password\n3. The scammers capture it and steal your money!\n\nIt's like a counterfeit shop that looks real but tricks you!\n\n✅ ALADDIN checks every site and warns you: \"Careful! That's a fake!\"",
            "faq_fake_apps": "What are fake apps?",
            "faq_fake_apps_answer": "A fake app is like a counterfeit phone. It looks real, but it's a scam!\n\nFraudsters create:\n• Fake Sberbank apps (to steal your money)\n• Fake WhatsApp (to read your messages)\n• Fake games (to grab your passwords)\n\n✅ ALADDIN inspects every app before installation and warns about danger.",
            "faq_malicious_links": "What are malicious links?",
            "faq_malicious_links_answer": "A malicious link is like a door into a trap. You tap it and fall right in!\n\nWhere they appear:\n• Messages from strangers\n• Ads on shady sites\n• Emails (\"Congratulations! You won...\")\n\n✅ ALADDIN scans every link and says: \"Stop! This link is dangerous!\"",
            "faq_phone_scam": "What is phone fraud?",
            "faq_phone_scam_answer": "Phone scammers call and try to trick people:\n• \"Hello, this is your bank! Your account is blocked, tell us the password\"\n• \"This is the police! Your son is in trouble, we need money\"\n• \"Congrats! You won a million! Transfer 5,000₽ to claim it\"\n\nRemember: NEVER share passwords over the phone!\n\n✅ ALADDIN blocks calls from known scam numbers.",
            "faq_financial_scam": "What is financial fraud?",
            "faq_financial_scam_answer": "Financial scammers want to steal your money:\n• \"Your card is blocked, follow this link\"\n• \"You've won a prize, pay a 3,000₽ tax\"\n• \"Urgent! Transfer money for a relative's treatment\"\n\nRule: Banks and government agencies NEVER ask for money by phone or messages!\n\n✅ ALADDIN flags these messages as scams.",
            "faq_social_engineering": "What is social engineering?",
            "faq_social_engineering_answer": "Social engineering is when a fraudster tricks you with words instead of hacking.\n\nExamples:\n• \"I'm your new colleague, I need access to the system\"\n• \"I'm tech support, tell me your password so I can check\"\n• \"Your mom is in the hospital! We urgently need money!\"\n\nThey play on your emotions—fear, greed, willingness to help.\n\n✅ ALADDIN teaches you how to spot these tricks.",
            "faq_fake_banks": "What are fake banks?",
            "faq_fake_banks_answer": "A fake bank is a website that looks like the real bank, but it's counterfeit!\n\nHow to spot it:\n• Real bank: sberbank.ru\n• Fake: sberbank-проверка.ru (hyphen, wrong ending)\n\nFraudsters copy the real design, but it's a trap!\n\n✅ ALADDIN checks the address and warns you: \"This is NOT the real bank!\"",
            "faq_inappropriate_content": "What is inappropriate content for children?",
            "faq_inappropriate_content_answer": "Inappropriate content is anything children shouldn't see:\n• Scary videos (violence, gore)\n• Adult websites\n• Explicit pictures and videos\n• Violent movies and games\n\nIt can frighten a child or teach harmful behavior!\n\n✅ ALADDIN automatically blocks content that doesn't match the child's age.",
            "faq_cyberbullying": "What is cyberbullying?",
            "faq_cyberbullying_answer": "Cyberbullying is when kids hurt other kids online:\n• Name-calling in chats\n• Posting embarrassing photos\n• Sending threats\n• Creating groups to harass someone\n\nIt hurts and scares!\n\n✅ ALADDIN detects abusive language and alerts parents. We also teach kids how to protect themselves.",
            "faq_dangerous_contacts": "What are dangerous online contacts?",
            "faq_dangerous_contacts_answer": "Dangerous contacts are when an unknown adult tries to befriend a child:\n• \"Hi! How are you? Let's be friends\"\n• \"You're so smart! Let's meet up?\"\n• \"Don't tell your parents about our chat\"\n\n⚠️ DANGER! Adults must not make secret friendships with kids online!\n\n✅ ALADDIN spots suspicious chats and notifies parents right away.",
            "faq_gaming_addiction": "What is gaming addiction?",
            "faq_password_theft_answer": "Password theft is when scammers learn your password and enter your accounts:\n• Steal money from the bank\n• Read your messages\n• Post in your name\n• Buy things with your money\n\n❌ Never reuse the same password everywhere!\n\n✅ ALADDIN checks if your passwords have been stolen.",
            "faq_fake_voices": "What are fake voices?",
            "faq_fake_voices_answer": "A fake voice is when a computer copies someone's voice:\n• A scammer calls mom speaking as her son: \"Mom, I urgently need money!\"\n• It sounds real, but it's a trick!\n\n⚠️ If someone calls asking for money, always call the person back yourself!\n\n✅ ALADDIN Premium analyzes voices and spots fakes.",
            "faq_fake_news": "What is fake news?",
            "faq_fake_news_answer": "Fake news is false information spread as if it were true:\n• \"Scientists found a cure for every disease!\" (false)\n• \"Earthquake in Moscow!\" (false if it didn't happen)\n• \"All banks are closing!\" (false)\n\nIt's created to mislead people or cause panic.\n\n✅ ALADDIN cross-checks news and shows whether it's true.",
            "faq_unsafe_wifi": "What is unsafe Wi‑Fi?",
            "faq_unsafe_wifi_answer": "Unsafe Wi‑Fi is a public network that can be a trap:\n• In cafés, airports, subways\n• Fraudsters can intercept your data\n• Steal passwords\n• See what you're doing\n\nIt's like someone standing behind you watching you type!\n\n✅ ALADDIN warns about risky networks and protects your traffic with VPN.",
            "faq_mitm_attacks": "What are man-in-the-middle attacks?",
            "faq_mitm_attacks_answer": "A man-in-the-middle attack is when a scammer intercepts the conversation between you and a service.\n\nHow it works:\n1. You think you're talking to the bank\n2. In reality the scammer sits \"in the middle\"\n3. They see everything you send (passwords, card data)\n4. They can replace the bank's reply with their own\n\nIt's like chatting while someone is secretly listening!\n\n✅ ALADDIN Premium uses special encryption so nobody can eavesdrop.",
            "faq_malicious_apps": "What are malicious apps?",
            "faq_malicious_apps_answer": "A malicious app looks normal but does harmful things:\n• Steals your photos\n• Reads messages\n• Tracks your location\n• Spends your money\n• Infects the phone with malware\n\nThey often hide inside:\n• Free games\n• \"Cool\" utilities\n• Apps from unknown developers\n\n✅ ALADDIN checks every app before you install it.",
            "faq_sms_scam": "What is SMS fraud?",
            "faq_sms_scam_answer": "SMS fraud is a scam message sent to your phone:\n• \"You won! Transfer money to receive your prize\"\n• \"Your bank account is blocked. Follow this link\"\n• \"Your package is delayed. Pay for delivery\"\n\n❌ Never wire money to strangers because of an SMS!\n\n✅ ALADDIN blocks such texts and warns you about the scam.",
            "faq_location_threats": "What are location-based threats?",
            "faq_location_threats_answer": "Location data shows where you are. The danger is that:\n• Scammers can learn where you live\n• They know when you're not at home\n• They can track your movements\n• They can use it for theft\n\nIt's like someone knowing your location every minute!\n\n✅ ALADDIN shields your location information.",
            "faq_domestic_violence": "What is digital domestic abuse?",
            "faq_domestic_violence_answer": "Digital domestic abuse is when someone in the family controls another person online:\n• Reads every message\n• Blocks contact with friends\n• Makes threats\n• Blackmails\n\nIt's serious and illegal!\n\n✅ ALADDIN Premium helps detect such situations and protects the victim.",
            "faq_emotional_problems": "Что такое эмоциональные проблемы?",
            "faq_emotional_problems_answer": "Эмоциональные проблемы появляются, когда интернет вредит настроению человека:\n• Ребенок чувствует себя грустным после социальных сетей\n• Постоянные сравнения делают его расстроенным\n• Он видит много негативного\n• Изолируется от настоящих друзей\n\n✅ ALADDIN отслеживает эмоциональные сигналы и предупреждает родителей, когда что-то кажется неправильным.",
            "faq_aes256": "Что такое военное шифрование AES-256?",
            "faq_aes256_answer": "AES-256 — это самый сильный способ защиты информации, который используют:\n• Банки\n• Военные\n• Правительства\n• Спецслужбы\n\nЭто как сейф с миллионом замков — его невозможно взломать!\n\n✅ ALADDIN Premium применяет AES-256 для максимальной защиты.",
            "faq_anonymity": "Что такое анонимность в интернете?",
            "faq_anonymity_answer": "Анонимность означает, что никто не знает, кто вы:\n• Ваш IP-адрес скрыт\n• Ваши действия не могут быть отслежены\n• Ваше местоположение приватно\n• Никто не может вас шпионить\n\nЭто как невидимость — люди видят активность, но не могут понять, что это вы!\n\n✅ ALADDIN Premium делает вас полностью анонимным в интернете.",
            "faq_critical_infrastructure": "What is critical infrastructure protection?",
            "faq_critical_infrastructure_answer": "Critical infrastructure means vital systems:\n• Hospitals\n• Power plants\n• Water supply\n• Transport\n• Banks\n\nIf they are hacked, thousands of people can suffer!\n\n✅ ALADDIN Premium defends such systems from attacks.",
            "faq_how_vpn_works": "How does VPN work?",
            "faq_how_vpn_works_answer": "VPN acts like an underground tunnel. When you're online:\n• Normally: Your phone → Provider → Internet (everyone sees where you go)\n• With VPN: Your phone → Encrypted tunnel → Internet (nobody sees!)\n\nIt's like invisibility—the internet sees a user but not who it is!\n\n✅ ALADDIN uses VPN to protect all your data.",
            "faq_parental_control_setup": "How do I set up parental controls?",
            "faq_parental_control_setup_answer": "Super easy!\n\n1. Open the \"Family\" section\n2. Select the child\n3. Configure:\n   • How long the phone can be used\n   • Which websites are allowed\n   • Which apps can run\n   • Who the child can talk to\n\n✅ ALADDIN helps parents protect children without spying on them.",
            "faq_cancel_subscription": "How do I cancel my subscription?",
            "faq_cancel_subscription_answer": "Easy! 😊\n\n1. Open \"Settings\"\n2. Find \"Manage subscription\"\n3. Tap \"Cancel subscription\"\n\nOr message our support team—we'll help!\n\nWe'll miss you, but we respect your choice! 💙",
            "faq_phishing_emails": "What are phishing emails?",
            "faq_phishing_emails_answer": "A phishing email is a deceptive message that pushes you to do something risky:\n• \"Your account is blocked, sign in via this link\"\n• \"You've won a prize! Click here\"\n• \"Someone tried to log in—verify here\"\n\n❌ Never click links in such emails!\n\n✅ ALADDIN scans emails and warns you about the danger.",
            "faq_dangerous_sites": "What are dangerous websites?",
            "faq_dangerous_sites_answer": "A dangerous site can harm your phone:\n• Infect it with a virus\n• Steal passwords\n• Trick you\n• Show harmful content\n\n✅ ALADDIN checks every site before it opens and warns you: \"This site is dangerous! Don't open it!\"",
            "faq_suspicious_downloads": "What are suspicious downloads?",
            "faq_suspicious_downloads_answer": "A suspicious download is a file that might be dangerous:\n• An app could be malware\n• A photo may hide a virus\n• A game might steal data\n\nHow to recognize it:\n• File from someone you don't know\n• Offer that's \"too good to be true\"\n• Strange file extension\n\n✅ ALADDIN checks every file before you download it.",
